{"metadata":{"role":"article","title":"Logging","modules":[{"name":"YubiKit"}],"roleHeading":"Article"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"No setup is required. YubiKit defaults to "},{"code":"debug","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" on stdout when compiled with "},{"code":"DEBUG","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or "},{"code":"info","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" on stderr otherwise. You can override either default:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["import YubiKit","import Logging","","\/\/ Show warnings and errors.","YubiKit.Logs.configure(logLevel: .warning)","","\/\/ Use your preferred backend.","YubiKit.Logs.configure(logLevel: .debug) { label in","    StreamLogHandler.standardOutput(label: label)","}","","\/\/ Turn logging off.","YubiKit.Logs.configure { _ in SwiftLogNoOpLogHandler() }","","\/\/ Restore defaults.","YubiKit.Logs.configure()"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/apple\/swift-log","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"Logging","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" product to your app target","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to use its backend types. Any SwiftLog ","type":"text"},{"code":"LogHandler","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" can be supplied by the factory.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Each call replaces both settings. Omitting the factory restores YubiKit’s backend;","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"omitting the level uses the selected handler’s level. Changes apply to existing sessions,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"though logs already in progress may use the previous settings.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"YubiKit’s configuration does not affect other libraries. To share your app’s backend,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"pass its factory explicitly; global "},{"code":"LoggingSystem.bootstrap","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" does not select YubiKit’s backend."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Factories may run concurrently and must not log through YubiKit themselves."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Traffic logging","level":3,"anchor":"Traffic-logging","type":"heading"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["YubiKit.Logs.configure(logLevel: .trace)"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Raw traffic and SCP plaintext logs require ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"YubiKit to be compiled with ","type":"text"},{"code":"DEBUG","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Neither configuration nor a custom backend can enable them in other builds.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Custom connections are responsible for their own traffic logging.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"warning","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Debug logs can include account names and credential identifiers.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Trace logs can include PINs, credentials, and cryptographic keys. Protect or redact logs before sharing them.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","name":"Warning"},{"anchor":"Custom-backends","level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Custom backends"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Labels identify categories, such as ","type":"text"},{"code":"com.yubico.YubiKit.OATH","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"code":"com.yubico.YubiKit.FIDO","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Metadata carries details such as byte counts and error codes; the default backend displays","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"these as ","type":"text"},{"code":"key=value","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" pairs. Message wording and metadata keys are not a stable API.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Your backend controls formatting, storage, and export. YubiKit does not retain log messages.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/yubikit\/loggingguide"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"text":"Choose YubiKit’s log level and backend with ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/Logs\/configure(logLevel:factory:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/LoggingGuide","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"article","seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Preparing your project","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/GettingStarted","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/Logs"],"anchor":"Preparing-your-project"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit"]]},"references":{"https://github.com/apple/swift-log":{"title":"SwiftLog","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/apple\/swift-log","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"SwiftLog"}],"type":"link","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/apple\/swift-log"},"doc://yubikit-swift.YubiKit/documentation/YubiKit/GettingStarted":{"abstract":[{"text":"Prepare your project to connect to the YubiKey via NFC, SmartCard, Lightning and USB HID.","type":"text"}],"role":"article","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/GettingStarted","title":"Getting Started","url":"\/documentation\/yubikit\/gettingstarted","kind":"article"},"documentation-header.png":{"variants":[{"traits":["2x","light"],"url":"\/images\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/docu